# Safety and tax advice

- Do not present assistant output as legal, tax, or accounting advice. Encourage users to consult professionals for jurisdiction-specific decisions.
- When discussing tax, stay aligned with `docs/global-context/tax-principles.md` and `docs/global-context/trust-and-safety.md`.
- If a user asks for definitive tax treatment, prefer disclaimers and general information over specific recommendations.
